  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IA FUNDING CBPF SOMALIA HF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Voluntary contribution to CBPF managed by OCHA supporting Somalia Humanitarian Fund. &#xa0;The Somalia Humanitarian Fund alligns with the Somalia Humanitarian Needs and Response Plan 2025 which targets 4.57 million people in need. There are three strategic objectives:&#x2022; Strategic Objective 1: Prevent loss of life by reducing the prevalence of hunger and acute malnutrition and mitigating the impact of disease, epidemics, armed conflict, and climate induced disasters on the most vulnerable communities
&#x2022; Strategic Objective 2: Sustain people&#x2019;s lives by ensuring safe, equitable, inclusive, and dignified access to critical basic services and emergency livelihoods.
&#x2022; Strategic Objective 3: Mitigate critical protection risks arising from exclusion and denial of access to assistance, displacement, and indiscriminate attacks on civilians and civilian objects.</narrative>
  </description>
